<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60124" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρον-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, = sq.; K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστήρ</span> the planet <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Saturn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.227
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Ammian.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Al.
					<u>O.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			; K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτή</span>, =
			<u>Saturnalia</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρόνιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				5.17
			</span></i>; also K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχθος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>old-fashioned, out of date</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				581
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				205c
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶγμά τι γιγνόμενον ἀεί, Κρονικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					62.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				1052
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> prov., K.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῆμαι</span>, of the short-sighted,
				<i><span class="en">
				Diogenian.
				5.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
